sequenceDiagram
    participant V as Vehicle
    participant CC as ChargingColumn
    participant E as EnergySandbox
    
    CC->>CC: Wait arrival_event
    CC->>CC: Select next EV (FCFS/SHRD)
    CC->>V: Handshake request
    V-->>CC: Handshake success
    
    loop Charging Windows
        CC->>E: Request power
        E-->>CC: Power granted
        CC->>V: Deliver energy
        alt Energy sufficient or disconnect requested
            CC->>V: Signal charge_cmpt_event
            CC->>CC: Break handshake
        else Continue charging
            CC->>CC: Next window
        end
    end